    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet The client demands for strict GDPR compliance, our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., must ensure that all data is hosted exclusively within the EU, as stated in we standard data residency policy. we also adhere to a cross-border transfer policy that prohibits data transfers outside the EU by default unless there is an explicit legal basis." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For encryption and pseudonymization of sensitive data, we utilize anonymisation tools such as Microsoft Presidio (self-hosted) and custom NER models. anonymisation tools such as Microsoft Presidio (self-hosted) and custom NER models are in line with GDPR requirements for protecting personal data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding explainability and transparency for recommendations or proposals issued by we AI systems, we ai_security_controls include output PII redaction and confidence threshold escalation. include ensures that any sensitive information is protected and that decisions based on AI outputs are subject to review." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Moreover, we model update security review process guarantees that no decision can be automated without explicit validation by an agent, aligning with the requirement for human oversight in decision-making processes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given these measures, we are compliant with The client regulatory requirements under GDPR. we ISO 27001 certification and experience with GDPR compliance further reinforce we capability to maintain high standards of data protection and security." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, having a Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointed and reachable at dpo@nexus-engineering.it ensures that data subjects' rights are properly addressed." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires compliance with the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR), explicability and transparency of recommendations, and no automation of decisions without explicit agent validation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client expects a tool of assistance that does not supersede human decision-making." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are we compliant with these regulatory obligations?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we context, we have experience with the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR) compliance as indicated by the presence of a Data Protection Agreement template version 3.2 and knowledge of standard legal basis for data processing under Article 6(1)(e) of the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we ai_regulatory_knowledge indicates awareness of prohibited AI practices, transparency obligations for limited-risk AI, and contractual enforcement of human oversight, aligning with the requirement for explicability and transparency of recommendations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, we no_automated_decision_without_human_validation_policy directly addresses the client's expectation that the tool should not supersede human decision-making. our no_automated_decision_without_human_validation_policy ensures that decisions are validated by humans before being implemented, mitigating the risk of unchecked automation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Therefore, we appear to be compliant with these regulatory obligations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, typical legal risks that we should continue to monitor include AI Act compliance evolution, given we limited-risk classification and the need to stay updated on regulatory changes, as well as vendor lock-in mitigation strategies such as source code escrow and adherence to open standards, to ensure continued control over the tool development and deployment." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client seeks an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in municipal agents daily missions, including search for information, help with drafting letters or answers, accompaniment in file instruction, and suggestion of actions." ;
