        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To assist with file instruction and suggest actions, we can draw upon our current research topics, particularly knowledge graphs for procedural reasoning." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This could enable the creation of a decision-support system that guides municipal agents through complex procedures by suggesting relevant steps or required documents based on the current state of a file. we innovation strategy would focus on integrating AI components into existing workflows without disruption. we have experience with similar use cases in public administration and legal sectors, where we solutions have been designed to complement human capabilities rather than replace human capabilities." ;
