    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., can address The client environmental concerns through Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. green hosting partners, such as OVHcloud and Scaleway, both located in France and powered by 100% renewable energy. our digital sobriety practices also reduce energy consumption, including INT8/INT4 model quantisation, which reduces GPU energy by approximately 40%, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching, and a green IT hardware procurement policy with a minimum 5-year lifecycle. our estimate that our proposed solution can typically reduce energy consumption by 35% compared to the baseline." ;
